sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant App as Flutter App / Web
  participant API as API (NestJS)
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant SMS as SMS/OTP Gateway
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  C->>App: Enter phone number to register/login
  App->>API: POST /auth/request-otp {phone}
  API->>Auth: Generate OTP + rate-limit check
  Auth->>DB: Store OTP hash (expires 5 min)
  Auth->>SMS: Send OTP code
  SMS-->>C: SMS with 6-digit code
  API-->>App: 200 {otpSent: true}
  C->>App: Enter received OTP
  App->>API: POST /auth/verify-otp {phone, code}
  API->>Auth: Verify OTP
  Auth->>DB: Validate + mark used
  alt Valid OTP
    Auth->>DB: Find or create user
    Auth-->>API: Issue JWT access + refresh tokens
    API-->>App: 200 {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
    App-->>C: Logged in / Home screen
  else Invalid or expired
    API-->>App: 401 {error: invalid_otp}
    App-->>C: Show error, allow retry
  end
